{"title":"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Replace <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> below with the number you receive.\n</p><p>Emil delivers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> newspapers every Saturday. One day he was sick, so his brother delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/b/5db9e227e8177d26de452c2a2faeb6d45cc53d7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> of the papers, his sister delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c339afa03e060d959e4942be7522c0c992f4c41c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the papers, his cousin delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> of the papers, and his dad delivered the remaining papers. How many papers did Emil’s dad deliver?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Everyone except the dad delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f7278c3a6ffc4104301a7b5091673054e784f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8} + \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{8} + \\frac{2}{8} + \\frac{4}{8} = \\frac{7}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"231\" height=\"38\" /> of the papers. This means that the dad delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1966d63b1e1fe7f70b75932b83e66956163aae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{8} - \\frac{7}{8} = \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" /> of the papers.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_3\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 3\">player 3</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/f/59fa4986dbf609a39478931a85ce5d6dfed12b12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N = 168$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />. This means that the dad delivered <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/c/16c9ae6713a454728131ff390d145d15819b9f3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{8} \\times 168 = \\boxed{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" /> papers.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC\">2023 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key